											<SHORT-NAME>MemAccSectorBatchRef</SHORT-NAME>
											<DESC>
												<L-2 L="EN">Reference to MemSectorBatch mapped to the SubAddressArea.



Note for multi binary use case:
If this MemAcc is configured as a satellite and requests to this SubAddress should be forwarded to a MemAcc master, only a reference to a dummy Mem driver should be set which should imitate the real Mem on the MemAcc master.
See technical reference for more information.</L-2>
